<title>SINGAPORE: SBS acquires cab company in London.</title>
<headline>SBS acquires cab company in London.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Bus Service (1978) Ltd (SBS) said on Tuesday it has agreed to buy London-based Computer Cab PLC for cash of 512,000 sterling pounds.</p>
<p>Computer Cab is one of the largest licensed taxi radio circuits in the United Kingdom with 2,100 taxi drivers currently subscribing to its circuit, it said.</p>
<p>SBS will hold 80 percent of Computer Cab through its subsidiary Afvron Pte Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
